TI  -  AIRPanc: a phase 2, open-label, multicenter, randomized study evaluating neoadjuvant therapy targeting the adenosine immunosuppressive pathway in combination with immune checkpoint blockade and radiation therapy in patients with advanced pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma who are candidates for surgical resection
