TI  -  Recurrent Disease Detection After Resection of Pancreatic Adenocarcinoma Using a Standardized Surveillance Strategy
JA  -  https://clinicaltrials.gov/ct2/show/NCT04875325
PY  -  2021
C3  -  CTgov NCT04875325
M3  -  Trial registry record
KW  -  Adenocarcinoma
