TI  -  Discrimination between circulating endothelial cells and blood cell populations with overlapping phenotype reveals distinct regulation and predictive potential in cancer therapy
JA  -  Neoplasia (New York, N.Y.)
PY  -  2011
VL  -  13
IS  -  10
SP  -  980‐990
C3  -  PUBMED 22028623
M3  -  Journal article
